{"id": "64335", "title": "百草传", "author": "梅梅探雪", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 8, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64335.htm", "intro": "（女尊）凌大小姐因为人长的国色天香,大学时代那个叫风靡全校,没想天有不测风云,人有旦夕祸福,刚毕业就被车撞死了.灵魂就这么一飘一飘,飘到了传说中的##国,还借尸还魂,还了个郡主来做.郡主可不是什么好差事,不如一个人逍遥自在,做不来就溜~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n一路美男云集,艳福齐天啊!", "base": "files/article/html/64/64335", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9591353.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9591355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9591357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9591360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9591365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9591366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9591367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9591368.html", "available": false}]}